## Multi-Agent Workflow

This project uses the hybrid dual-model approach for substantial implementations:

1. `/scope` — Define the problem, acceptance criteria, and affected files (Claude)
2. `/architect` — Design the architecture and implementation plan (GPT)
3. `/build` — Implement the changes following the conventions above (Claude)
4. `/review` — Code review and security analysis (GPT)
5. `/verify` — Run tests, lint, and confirm constraints are satisfied (Claude)

**GPT hybrid workflow guide:** `AGENTS.md`
**Master workflow doc:** `~/.claude/WORKFLOW.md` (single-session orchestrator,
phase mode, troubleshooting)
